<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Mortgage Rate Trends</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .header-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
        .nav-links a { margin-left: 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #555; }
        .main-content { margin-top: 30px; }
        .chart-container { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 350px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .expert-poll-box { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; width: 45%; float: right; margin-top: 20px; }
        .expert-poll-box h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .poll-option { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 5px 0; }
        .divider { border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0; }
        .section-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .text-block { line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .quote-block { border-left: 4px solid #ccc; padding-left: 20px; margin: 40px 0; font-style: italic; }
        .quote-block p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
        .quote-block footer { font-style: normal; font-size: 0.9em; color: #777; }
        .rate-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        .rate-table th, .rate-table td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left; }
        .rate-table th { background-color: #f4f4f4; font-weight: bold; }
        .loan-details-form { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; align-items: flex-end; }
        .form-group { flex: 1; }
        .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .form-group input, .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .author-bio { margin-top: 40px; }
        .author-bio h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .author-card { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .author-card img { width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 20px; }
        .author-info h3 { margin: 0 0 5px 0; }
        .author-info p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9em; color: #555; }
        .highlight-list { list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; }
        .footer-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 0.8em; color: #777; }
        .subscription-form { text-align: center; margin: 50px 0; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #eee; }
        .subscription-form input[type="email"] { padding: 10px; width: 60%; max-width: 300px; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
        .subscription-form button { padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer; margin-left: 10px; }
    </style>

<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-bar">
        <div class="logo">Bankrate</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#">Mortgages</a>
            <a href="#">Advertiser Disclosure</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-content">
        <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold;">Expert Poll: Mortgage Rate Trend Predictions For Oct. 21-27, 2021</h1>

        <div class="chart-container">
            <!-- Placeholder for main chart image -->
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <p>Written by <span data-field="author.full_name">{{ author.full_name }}</span></p>
                <p>Oct. 20, 2021 / 5 min read</p>
                <div class="text-block">
                    <p>At Bankrate we strive to help you make smarter financial decisions. While we adhere to strict <a href="#">editorial integrity</a>, this post may contain references to products from our partners. Here's an explanation for <a href="#">how we make money</a>.</p>
                    <p>Mortgage experts mostly expect rates to rise in the week ahead (Oct. 21-27). In response to Bankrate's weekly poll, 64 percent said rates will go up. Meanwhile, 27 percent said they would stay put and just 9 percent expect them to fall. Calculate your monthly payment using Bankrate's <a href="#">mortgage calculator</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="expert-poll-box">
                <h3>Experts say rates will ...</h3>
                <div class="poll-option">
                    <span>Go up</span>
                    <span><span data-field="poll_results.go_up_percent">{{ poll_results.go_up_percent }}</span>%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="poll-option">
                    <span>Stay the same</span>
                    <span><span data-field="poll_results.stay_same_percent">{{ poll_results.stay_same_percent }}</span>%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="poll-option">
                    <span>Go down</span>
                    <span><span data-field="poll_results.go_down_percent">{{ poll_results.go_down_percent }}</span>%</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="main-content">
        <h2 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold;">Experts predict where mortgage rates are headed</h2>
        <p>Week of Oct 21 - 27</p>

        <!-- Placeholder for pie chart -->
        <div style="height: 300px; margin: 30px 0;"></div>

        <h3>Experts say rates will ...</h3>
        <div class="poll-option">
            <span>Go up</span>
            <span><span data-field="poll_results.go_up_percent">{{ poll_results.go_up_percent }}</span>%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="poll-option">
            <span>Stay the same</span>
            <span><span data-field="poll_results.stay_same_percent">{{ poll_results.stay_same_percent }}</span>%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="poll-option">
            <span>Go down</span>
            <span><span data-field="poll_results.go_down_percent">{{ poll_results.go_down_percent }}</span>%</span>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h2 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold;">Current Mortgage Rates for October 2021</h2>
        <p>Advertiser Disclosure</p>

        <div class="loan-details-form">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="purchase">Purchase</label>
                <input type="text" id="purchase" value="<span data-field="loan_details.purchase_id">{{ loan_details.purchase_id }}</span>">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="refinance">Refinance</label>
                <input type="text" id="refinance" value="<span data-field="loan_details.refinance_id">{{ loan_details.refinance_id }}</span>">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="zip">Zip Code</label>
                <input type="text" id="zip" value="<span data-field="loan_details.zip_code">{{ loan_details.zip_code }}</span>">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="property_value">Property Value</label>
                <input type="text" id="property_value" value="<span data-field="loan_details.property_value">{{ loan_details.property_value }}</span>">
            </div>
        </div>

        <table class="rate-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Lender</th>
                    <th>APR</th>
                    <th>Rate</th>
                    <th>Mo. payment</th>
                    <th></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for rate_entry in rate_listings %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="rate_listings[{{ loop.index0 }}].lender_name">{{ rate_listings[loop.index0].lender_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="rate_listings[{{ loop.index0 }}].apr">{{ rate_listings[loop.index0].apr }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="rate_listings[{{ loop.index0 }}].rate">{{ rate_listings[loop.index0].rate }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="rate_listings[{{ loop.index0 }}].monthly_payment">{{ rate_listings[loop.index0].monthly_payment }}</span></td>
                    <td><a href="#">Next</a></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 15px;">
            <a href="#">Show more options</a>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9em;">
            1 - 4 of 21 <a href="#">&lt;</a> <a href="#">&gt;</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="main-content">
        <div class="quote-block">
            <p>"If you haven't refinanced to a lower rate yet, don't let this train leave you at the station."</p>
            <footer>— <span data-field="quote_author_name">{{ quote_author_name }}</span>, <span data-field="quote_author_title">{{ quote_author_title }}</span></footer>
        </div>

        <div class="author-card">
            <img src="" alt="Author Photo">
            <div class="author-info">
                <h3><span data-field="author_name">{{ author_name }}</span></h3>
                <p><span data-field="author_title">{{ author_title }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-block">
            <p><span data-field="author_summary_paragraph_1">{{ author_summary_paragraph_1 }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="author_summary_paragraph_2">{{ author_summary_paragraph_2 }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Highlights</div>
        <ul class="highlight-list">
            <li><span data-field="highlight_item_1">{{ highlight_item_1 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="highlight_item_2">{{ highlight_item_2 }}</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="author-bio">
            <h2>About the Author</h2>
            <p><span data-field="author_bio_paragraph_1">{{ author_bio_paragraph_1 }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="author_bio_paragraph_2">{{ author_bio_paragraph_2 }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="author_bio_paragraph_3">{{ author_bio_paragraph_3 }}</span></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="main-content">
        <div class="subscription-form">
            <p>Stay on top of ever-changing rates</p>
            <p>Get customized rate alerts delivered directly to your inbox.</p>
            <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" aria-label="Email Address">
                <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
            </form>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 15px;">By clicking 'Subscribe', I agree to Bankrate.com's <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="#">Terms of Use</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="main-content">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 50px;">
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;">About</h3>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">About us</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Press room</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Careers</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Advertise with us</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Site map</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Help</h3>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Contact us</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Compare rates</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Latest news</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Popular topics</a></li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#">Glossary</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="font-size: 10pt; color: #666;">
    <span data-field="document_date">{{ document_date }}</span>, <span data-field="document_time">{{ document_time }}</span> AM
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 10pt; color: #666;">
    <span data-field="document_title">{{ document_title }}</span> - <span data-field="document_source">{{ document_source }}</span>
  </div>

  <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px;">Legal</h1>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="privacy_policy_link">{{ privacy_policy_link }}</span></p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Cookie Settings</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Do not sell my info</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Understanding Bankrate's averages</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Terms of use</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">GLBA annual notice</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Licenses</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 40px;">How we make money</h2>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>Bankrate.com is an independent, advertising-supported publisher and comparison service. Bankrate is compensated in exchange for featured placement of sponsored products and services, or your clicking on links posted on this website. This compensation may impact how, where and in what order products appear. Bankrate.com does not include all companies or all available products.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px;">Bankrate, LLC NMLS ID #<span data-field="nmls_id_bankrate">{{ nmls_id_bankrate }}</span> | <span data-field="nmls_consumer_access_bankrate">{{ nmls_consumer_access_bankrate }}</span></p>
    <p style="margin-top: 5px;">BR Tech Services, Inc. NMLS ID #<span data-field="nmls_id_brtech">{{ nmls_id_brtech }}</span> | <span data-field="nmls_consumer_access_brtech">{{ nmls_consumer_access_brtech }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
      <a href="#" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;"><span data-field="social_media_facebook">{{ social_media_facebook }}</span></a>
      <a href="#" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;"><span data-field="social_media_twitter">{{ social_media_twitter }}</span></a>
      <a href="#" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;"><span data-field="social_media_instagram">{{ social_media_instagram }}</span></a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span data-field="bankrate_us_link">{{ bankrate_us_link }}</span> | <span data-field="bankrate_uk_link">{{ bankrate_uk_link }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 9pt; color: #666; text-align: center;">
    &copy; <span data-field="copyright_year">{{ copyright_year }}</span> Bankrate, LLC. A Red Ventures company. All Rights Reserved.
  </div>
</div></body>
</html>